# First publish — Player only

The first public product is the **Player Character generator** (Home, Generate, sheet, shareable Character URL).

- Do not spend implementation time on NPC, NPC list, DM Companion, dungeons, or Epica unless Julio reopens that cut.
- Do not delete parked chrome. Restore later by setting `PLAYER_ONLY_PUBLISH = False` in `app/publish_scope.py`.
- Do not merge live `AtlasAlusoris/` with `AtlasActorLudi/AtlasAlusoris/` (QST-0081.5).
- Prefer Player-generator Questae (QST-0001, QST-0002, QST-0050.1, QST-0050.2) over parked NPC/DM Questae.
- A Guild the generator cannot build must not stay in the picker (Artificer: QST-0050.2).
